      "id": "a3",
      "n": 3,
      "ord": 3,
      "search_text": "",
      "section": [],
      "text": "**CC:** Roger, Tranquility. We copy you on the ground. You got a bunch of guys about to turn blue. We're breathing again. Thanks a lot.",
      "unit": "t3"
    },
    {
